quick_recap.md

# UPSTREAM_BUGS*.md was ignored here as "local working notes". It is tracked now.
#
# It had grown into 33 defects found in Frappe and Frappe CRM while porting them, each
# with file:line evidence and our stance - reproduce or diverge - and the reasoning for
# it. That is the most portable thing this repo contains, and it existed on one laptop.
#
# It is also what a reviewer needs: when this port behaves differently from upstream, the
# answer to "is that a port bug?" lives in that file. The per-phase progress files carry
# one-line summaries, so the findings survived being ignored; the reasoning did not.